WEBVTT

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.410
Whoops.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:24.330
Maybe I should've flown over the forest.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:26.120
It's too late, though.

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:28.740
I guess I just have to keep going.

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:34.370
They say that beautiful flowers have thorns.

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:40.240
Occasionally, beautiful things will
bare their fangs when you touch them.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:48.120
By the way, on another note,

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:54.080
who is this beauty blooming as
beautifully as the most colorful flowers?

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.700
That's right, it's me.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:38.010
The Girl as Pretty as a Flower

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:43.240
What a magnificent field of flowers.

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:44.950
Oh?

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:53.290
Um, excuse me--

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.240
Oh, hello.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:58.080
Are you the one taking
care of this flower field?

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:00.990
There's no one taking care of this flower field.

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:04.450
I'm just here because I like flowers.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:08.240
I'm just playing with the flowers
while basking in the sun.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:12.370
Then, these flowers are growing here naturally?

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:14.700
That's amazing...

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:18.830
Traveler, are you a witch?

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:21.240
I wonder if I might ask a favor of you.

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:23.580
I'll do what I can.

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:30.990
I'd like you to bring this bouquet
to the country you are about to enter.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:35.040
I don't mind, but who should I give it to?

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:39.790
Anyone. What's important is that
someone thinks these flowers are beautiful.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:45.240
In other words, you'd like me
to advertise this flower field?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:46.160
You don't want to?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.700
I'll do it happily.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.080
Thank you, traveler.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:54.990
Very well. I'll make sure
to give these to someone.

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.040
Take care!

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.990
Girl, stop!

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:17.950
"Girl"? Hmph.

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:19.490
Hey! Stop!

00:04:19.490 --> 00:04:21.120
I told you to stop!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:23.240
Do you have business with me?

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.450
Are you a traveler?

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:27.290
Can't you tell by looking?

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:29.040
What's with that bouquet of flowers?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.120
It's nothing.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:32.740
Show it to me!

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.330
Hey, wait!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.540
You... Where did you get this?

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:38.990
Does it matter?

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:40.870
It has nothing to do with you.

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:42.290
Please return it.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:45.120
Hey, what are you doing?

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:46.990
I'll take care of the rest. You go back.

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:50.870
Sir, this shawl... and these
flowers... They might be--

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.830
Go back!

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:54.450
Did you not hear me?

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:56.540
You should go rest.

00:04:58.490 --> 00:05:01.540
Oh, please return the bouquet.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:06.330
Here.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.330
Thanks.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.120
Sorry, Miss Witch.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.540
Recently, his younger sister went missing,

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:15.490
and he's been like that ever since.

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:16.740
Please forgive him.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.580
It doesn't bother me.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:21.620
That's a lie, though.

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:26.240
By the way, sorry, but will you
let us dispose of those flowers?

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.830
They are not allowed into this country.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.370
What do you mean?

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:34.700
Those flowers are poisonous.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:35.620
Poisonous?

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.830
But I was fine...

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.870
They won't do anything to a witch,

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:44.950
but there's magic in them that will make
people who can't use magic go insane.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.540
It makes people go insane?

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:50.580
Yes, people who are mesmerized by the flowers

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.290
are drawn to them like bees to honey

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.700
and led to where the flowers bloom,

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.990
becoming nutrients for them to feed off of.

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:02.080
That's why you must dispose of them?

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:05.160
Is something the matter?

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.240
No...

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:09.490
Sorry about this. You can go.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.580
It was me!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:26.080
Naw, you were just imagining it.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.660
Flower field...

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:38.370
In my favorite book, <i>The Adventures of Niké</i> ,

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:43.580
there is a story about a strange plant.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:49.410
Normally, plants release magic
for us after absorbing sunlight.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:53.830
But, through a sudden mutation,
it started sucking magic,

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.580
became sentient, and started acting violently.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.990
That's what the story was about.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:00.080
Could it be...?

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:07.450
The next day, before
I left for the next country,

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:10.160
I went to the flower field
I had visited the day before.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:13.240
There was something I wanted to check.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:17.620
Hello.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:23.370
Oh, thanks for yesterday...

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:25.330
About your sister?

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:27.830
I finally found her...

00:07:27.830 --> 00:07:32.200
...thanks to your bringing
her shawl and that bouquet.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:36.040
I figured out that she was here...

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:40.620
I finally... finally found her...

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:50.620
You've become so pretty...

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:54.870
Trying to keep such
a wonderful place to yourself...

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:59.410
Come on, let's show this place
to everyone in the country, too.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.370
I'm sure they'll like it.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:06.620
Besides, I want to show you off now
that you've become as pretty as a flower.

00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:08.700
Hey, that's fine, right?

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.950
I see, thanks.

00:08:10.950 --> 00:08:14.410
You really are pretty...

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:06.040
Bottled Happiness

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:19.660
Hey...!

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.700
Oh, you came!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:23.790
Hello.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.830
Hello!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:30.290
You're a real witch! That's amazing!

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:32.990
What're you doing in a place like this?

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:34.450
I'm a traveler.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.620
So, I'm on a journey.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:37.580
What about you?

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:40.160
I'm looking for happiness.

00:09:40.160 --> 00:09:42.330
Happiness?

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:43.830
What's that?

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:47.290
It's a bottle where I'm gathering happiness.

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.370
You're gathering happiness?

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:53.290
I turn the moments people and
animals feel happiness into magic

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.990
and put them into this bottle!

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.830
So you can use magic, too?

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:02.290
Are you changing feelings into magic?

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:04.580
Yeah, you could say that.

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:06.040
Can I open it?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.450
No, you can't.

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:11.040
If you open this here, then my
hard work will come to nothing.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:15.870
These are precious treasures
I've been gathering for the girl I like.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:19.330
Oh, are you mad?

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:22.290
No, I'm a little moved.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:25.370
It reminded me of a book I read in the past.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:26.330
A book?

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:28.580
Yes.

00:10:28.580 --> 00:10:31.370
For the sake of his wife, who was sick
and couldn't leave the house,

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:34.240
a husband travels around the world,

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:37.080
recreating beautiful views with magic

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:40.660
so he could bring them home
and show them to his wife.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.330
Oh? What happened?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:46.240
I bet his wife was really happy!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.700
I can't remember...

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:51.240
I'm sure she was healed and lived a long life!

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:53.370
Maybe that was it.

00:10:53.370 --> 00:10:56.410
So, who's this girl you like?

00:10:56.410 --> 00:11:00.620
She's a servant named Nino
who works at my house.

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:04.450
She always looks gloomy,
so I want to cheer her up.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:08.830
That's why I'm bottling up happiness.

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:10.660
I see.

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.990
Feelings of plants?

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:14.830
Yeah!

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:17.330
I tried to see if I could
get happiness from them,

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.080
but it didn't really work.

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:21.700
You're lucky the plants didn't use you for food.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:22.540
Huh?

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.040
Oh, nothing.

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:26.830
Oh, you can see it up ahead!

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.450
What a peaceful village.

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.080
Right?

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.790
Is that the village chief's house?

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:47.120
It's my house, too!

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.700
Oh?

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:51.290
You don't seem that interested, Miss Witch.

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:54.200
Would it be better for me to act surprised?

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:58.290
Wow, that's amazing! You're rich, aren't you?

00:11:58.290 --> 00:12:01.200
Uh, right, never mind.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:04.790
When will you give her that bottle?

00:12:04.790 --> 00:12:07.450
I think I'll give it to her
after we finish lunch.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.240
Oh, right! Why don't you come eat lunch with us?

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:13.740
The food Nino makes is really good!

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:18.450
Thank you for the invitation,
but I just ate breakfast.

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:21.080
Then, I'll make sure you get a smaller portion.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:23.290
Are there any foods you don't like or can't eat?

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:25.490
I don't like mushrooms...

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:27.540
Got it. I'll make sure she doesn't put any in.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.870
Please make sure it's a small portion.

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:31.160
Leave it to me.

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:33.540
The food'll definitely be really delicious--

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:35.450
made by Nino!

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:38.740
Anyway, make yourself at home.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.580
Thanks.

00:12:50.370 --> 00:12:53.040
H-Hello...

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:57.660
Hello.

00:12:57.660 --> 00:13:00.870
Could you be from a land in the east?

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:03.410
Huh? U-Um...

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:06.620
Oh, you just seemed similar to someone I know.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.330
You're right!

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:12.410
My dad found her in an eastern land.

00:13:12.410 --> 00:13:14.540
Found...

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.290
So that's why you're here...?

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:18.120
Y-Yes...

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:23.540
The village chief is... very kind...

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:27.080
Where is the village chief?

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:30.290
He's working in his study...

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:33.490
Hey, hey, Nino! What's for lunch today?

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:39.990
T-Today, the village chief said
he wants... fish grilled with salt...

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:43.120
Can you make some for
Miss Witch over there, too?

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:44.870
It's fine, Miss Witch!

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.410
Thank you very much.

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:48.370
But please don't give me too much.

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.120
R-Right.

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:52.080
Oh, yeah, Nino!

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:55.910
I have a present for you after lunch.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.080
F-For me?

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.200
Yeah! Look forward to it.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.990
N-No, that's not necessary.

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:04.870
The village chief will be angry.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:09.330
Don't worry about it! I'll explain to Dad.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:11.160
No, but...

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.870
Then, this is an order from me:

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:16.950
Take the present, Nino.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:19.540
How about that?

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.580
If it's an order...

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:23.410
Yeah!

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.700
Shall I help with something?

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:27.700
You can have a seat, Miss Witch.

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:30.370
We'll take care of the food.

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:39.160
Oh? It's unusual for us to have a guest.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.240
Are you the village chief?

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.990
Indeed I am.

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:45.330
I am the traveling witch, Elaina.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.290
Nice to meet you.

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:50.290
What a polite young lady.

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:56.120
Please make yourself at home.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:26.450
Thanks for waiting!

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:28.790
S-Sorry to keep you waiting...

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:38.120
This is a <i>small</i> portion...?

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.790
Is something the matter?

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:44.330
No... Well, shall we eat...?

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.740
Let's eat!

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:55.830
Thank you for the food. It was very good.

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:59.870
O-Oh, thank you... very much...

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.700
I'll put the dishes away.

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:02.410
I'll help, too--

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:04.910
Oh, don't worry about it, Miss Witch.

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.240
You met Nino in a land in the east?

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:25.200
Yeah, I bought her.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.200
Bought...?

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.330
She's a slave.

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:31.490
A few years ago, my wife left.

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:35.580
There was a period when we had
problems getting the housework done.

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:40.080
I found her in an eastern land when
I was there for work around that time.

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:43.540
She was expensive,
but she could do some housework,

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:46.040
and most of all, she is sure to
be a beauty when she grows up,

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:47.870
so I bought her without any hesitation.

00:16:47.870 --> 00:16:52.450
As I thought, she's a great servant.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:55.990
Does Emil know about this?

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.160
I told him,

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:03.120
but he doesn't care if the
other person is a slave or what.

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:15.540
Hey, Nino, where should I put the big plat--

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:20.740
What are you doing?!

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:22.200
You worthless piece of junk!

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:25.370
How long will it take before you
learn to do your job perfectly?!

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.410
Hurry up and clean it up!

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:30.580
I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:30.580
Clean it up!

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:31.990
Stop it, Dad!

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.540
That was <i>my</i> fault just now.

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.290
Nino didn't--

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:37.120
<i>You</i> shut up!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.370
Clean it up!

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:38.950
Yes, sir...

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.240
You don't need to clean it up.

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:42.870
Huh?

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:15.620
Next time, be careful not to drop it.

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:18.290
O-Oh, sorry about that.

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:23.370
For you to see something so disgraceful,
and then even fixing the china for us...

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.240
Come on, you thank her properly, too.

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:29.080
U-Um, I'm sorry...

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:34.080
At times like this, you should say "Thank you."

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:38.330
Thank you... very much...

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:39.740
You're welcome.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:46.330
I could've done magic like that.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.160
Oh my, I'm sorry.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:50.370
Was my help unwelcome?

00:18:50.370 --> 00:18:53.200
No. Thanks, Miss Witch.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:55.290
You're very welcome.

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:58.160
But, I could've...

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:06.370
Speaking of which, Nino seems very
depressed right now, doesn't she?

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:10.240
Isn't this the perfect time
to give her present to her?

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:13.540
Miss Witch, you might be a genius!

00:19:14.660 --> 00:19:17.490
Feel free to praise me more.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:26.080
I said earlier that I had
a present for you, right?

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.450
Y-Yes.

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:31.370
Here, this is your present.

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:34.700
This is a bottle filled with happiness.

00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:36.830
Happiness...?

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:41.370
It's filled with the happiness of
various people I found in various places.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:44.870
The happiness of... various people...?

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:48.040
You can only see it once, so look carefully.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.700
Come on, let's open it.

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.620
Ready, go!

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:01.370
These are pieces of happiness!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:34.240
The outside world is
filled with all this happiness.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:37.240
So don't always look so gloomy.

00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:39.830
I'll make you happy.

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:43.240
Make me... happy...?

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:04.830
Come back and visit, okay?

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:05.990
When you come back,

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:11.160
Nino and I will make food that's
even more delicious for you! Right?

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:13.120
Yes, I'll come back and visit.

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:14.490
Bye.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.660
Bye!

00:21:29.160 --> 00:21:32.200
What lovely colors.

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:37.950
It was then that I remembered the
ending of the book I read in the past--

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:44.290
The beautiful scenes the husband brought home

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:50.580
ended up making his wife, who couldn't
go anywhere, even more depressed.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:52.830
And then, his wife...

00:21:55.410 --> 00:22:00.490
"Just because you are doing something
for someone else doesn't make it right."

00:22:00.490 --> 00:22:05.240
It was a really preachy story.

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:10.330
Kindness and beauty can sometimes become cruel.

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:14.580
I don't know what happened to Nino after that.

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:17.870
No, I don't <i>want</i> to know...
